.SH NAME
gyro-domain-child-nameserver-create - Create child nameserver


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro domain child-nameserver create  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Create child nameserver

.PP
Core WISECP client endpoint. Reference: https://dev.wisecp.com/tr/ad-sunuculari-ve-kayitlar

.PP
API: POST /domains/{domain}/child-nameservers (operationId coreCreateChildNameserver, scope Domains/CreateChildNameserver)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for create

.PP
\fB--host\fP=""
	Sunucunun tam adı. Küçük harfe çevrilir.

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--ip\fP=""
	Sunucunun adresi. Biçimi doğrulanır.

.PP
\fB--ns\fP=""
	ns

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)


